          "_name": "features10",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features10\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\"> \n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show SubTitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Icons\" name=\"showIcons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Content Title\" name=\"showContentTitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#555555\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#c1c1c1\" condition=\"gradientBg&& bg.type=='color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color 2\" name=\"overlayColor2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" value=\"#1ec5bf\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container':cardsAmount<5,'container-fluid':cardsAmount>4}\">\n        <div class=\"container align-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"mb-4 mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Our Main&nbsp;<b>Services</b></h2>\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-5 mbr-light mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Our main services are Cyber Security, Network Design and Support, and Information System Auditing and Security Control. Our people are highly experienced and qualified to deliver at the highest levels.</h3>\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-4\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '2',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white mdi-hardware-security\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Cyber Security</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '2',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white icon54-v1-network-cable\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Network Design &amp; Support</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '2','col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white imind-data-network\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Information Systems Auditing and Security Control</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-4\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '2',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white sli-earphones-alt\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Increase your productivity!!! With over 20 years experience in helping people and corporate organizations run their IT Facilities on site, we have the necessary experience and technical competence to provide your organization with a highly efficient and functional<br>helpdesk.</p>\n                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Help Desk</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '2',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white mdi-communication-business\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">With every project comes a range of tasks that are not easy to coordinate. We at DSI specialize to putting order to the \"madness\" of any project. We have at our disposal a team of qualified Project Managers with specialty in Construction and Information Technology.<br><br>We await the opportunity to provide such services to you. Full life cycle project management services is an effective complement to our suite of Network Design Services.DSI don't just finish a contract or assignment and walk away. We follow up with clients to make sure everything work as expected and to the books. DSI customers value after sales services and we follow true on their demands.</p>\n                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Business Services</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-4\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '2','col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white icon54-v1-network-plug\"></span><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-white li_lock\" style=\"position: relative; left: -1.2rem; top: 0.7rem; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(149, 29, 25); fill: rgb(149, 29, 25);\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">We have a wide array of products that will greatly mitigate all forms of network attacks and intrusions including viruses, spam, phishing etc. Using our skills in positioning and configuring firewalls, IPS devices, VPN concentrators, anti viruses, LAN security enforcement devices, etc, we will protect your valuable data and network resources from unauthorized access.<br></p>\n                        <p class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Network Security</b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
